<title>UK: John Lewis UK store sales up 16.3% in week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK store sales up 16.3% in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said its UK weekly department store sales rose 16.3 percent in the week to June 28 from the same week a year earlier.</p>
<p>In the 22 weeks to June 28, sales were up 10.0 percent.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, rose 8.7 percent in the latest week and 7.0 percent in the 22-week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
